  "bodyHash": "78c73dab4f59ecb0",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\">(我的第一個模組/資料包)</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_a926bc6e-7202-4d5d-b3ec-ad14554db92e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"808\" height=\"361\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為 Epic Samurai、Epic Knights、Dungeon Weapons、Born in Chaos、Simply Swords 及其他多款模組的武器，提供與 Epic Fight、Weapons of Miracles、Epic Fight Battle Styles 及其他擴充功能的相容性。</strong></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>更多內容！EFM Compat 的全新 Trails 貼圖！<br></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">預期相容模組</span></span></span>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">為獲得完整體驗而必須安裝的依賴項</span>）：</h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/881/915/638312712562327674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a> 由 maninthe_home/yesman 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/884/152/638318074504658168.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles</a> (wom) 由 reascer 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/915/178/638372918905326451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ef-bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Battle Styles</a> (ef-bs) 由 Forixaim 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/862/853/638271674802985984.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-guandao-moveset\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight - Guandao Moveset </a>(falchionmoveset) 由 namelesslk 開發</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請查看附加檔案以下載資源包，用於修復並新增貼圖。</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>（在我想辦法將貼圖包內建於資料包之前，這將是獲取貼圖包的方式）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/952176/description_20d558b2-164b-4554-937a-789442eeaa53.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"384\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">推薦模組：</h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/963/317/638461000018381994.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-irons-spells-armor-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight x Iron's Spells Armor Fix</a>&nbsp;由 cacheing 開發</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">此資料包/模組旨在讓 Epic Fight 與各種模組相容。武器招式已根據我的個人喜好進行調整，歡迎自行修改以符合您的喜好。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>嘗試屬於自己的戰鬥風格：</strong></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">如何為 Epic Fight 製作自訂武器與護甲的資料包：</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f%2523onetwo-handed-weapon-file\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://epicfight-docs.readthedocs.io/Guides/page2/#onetwo-handed-weapon-file</a></h4>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">支援來自以下模組的武器：</h2>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/778/486/638122554849559119.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born In Chaos</a> 由 mongoose_artist 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/805/606/638172713304550451.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-samurais\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Samurai</a> 由 VeroxUniverse 開發</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/411/944/637630777607986862.png\" alt=\"Epic Knights\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a>/magistuarmory 由 magistu_ 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/789/196/638143347801778495.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-dungeons-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Weapons</a> 由 thespringaling 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/611/576/637996129346404798.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Simply Swords</a> 由 sweenuss 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/190/975/636857615673605328.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a>&nbsp;由 sbom_xela 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/937/893/638416517376113534.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcdw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Dungeon Weapons</a> 由 chronos_sacaria 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/892/693/638335183690820532.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights Addon </a>由 magistu_ 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/464/755/637744772991786976.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae</a> 由 Obscuria 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/897/696/638342973699298752.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabled </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabled-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weaponry</a> 由 DaddyUnion 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/396/11/637595005615179370.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 由 verctorwing 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/871/265/638288661913483053.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a> 由 Iron431 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/460/870/637739722679428303.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm</a> 由 mcl_ender 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/506/233/637824423557821613.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquary-reincarnations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reliquary Reincarnations</a> 由 P3pp3rF1y 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/258/931/637209858883035931.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vampirism - Become a vampire!</a> 由 maxanier 與 Cheaterpaul 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/566/189/637924794889476652.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-potioneering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave's Potioneering </a>由 SoterDave 開發</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/816/783/638194171174203953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a>由 TheAetherTeam 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/883/158/638315999771583464.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Basic Weapons</a> 由 Khazoda 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/838/790/638231371029924457.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomancy</a> 由 Elenterius 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/241/891/637131079632015619.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a> 由 ModdingLegacy 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/798/638390956074205375.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/923/851/638391125861006765.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementus-arcane\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elementus:Arcane</a> 由 Nokunami 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/834/456/638225202891768109.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/889/312/638328880372078491.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-paladins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Paladins</a> &amp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(38, 38, 38)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-empires\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Empires</a> 由 VeroxUniverse 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/772/533/638112628921999420.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden Arcanus</a> 由 cesar_zorak 開發</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/761/310/638097611993061146.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knave's Needs</a> 由 KodoDenka 開發</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/796/600/638156948581632807.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2 Weaponry</a> by Icy0x1</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/555/994/637900334510568136.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">-RPG Style </a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">More</a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-style-more-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Weapons!</a> by zrikon</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/614/129/637997268560849585.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Weapons for Better Combat</a><em> <s>(現已支援 Epic Fight！)</s>&nbsp;</em>by InfernalEclipse</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/14/212/635589178760357568.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> by Benimatic</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/280/925/637283672869883111.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> by Quek04</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/679/638025764121686580.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plus the End</a> by praizazdd7724（僅限 1.8）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/887/654/638325263575103332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></strong></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eeeabs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">EEEAB's Mobs</a> by EEEAB</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>未來還有更多內容！...</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">其他相容性：</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/825/222/638210773187460598.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a> by talhanation</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/896/228/638341222431292689.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-of-gaming-continued\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics Of Gaming Continued</a>（僅更改了 Trail 效果）by power282</h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">本資料包由 <strong>ElC4</strong> 製作，並獲得 Йохан Петрович 的貢獻，其基礎參考了以下其他資料包：</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-simplyswords with epicfight by sunwoolove777</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">-epic-knights-EFM（來自 epic knights Discord 伺服器）</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">問與答</h1>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你們會新增這個模組嗎？[可插入任何武器模組名稱]</strong></h4>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>我已經留意到評論區推薦的模組。當我有空開發此模組時，我會測試這些模組與 Epic Fight 的相容性。有些模組（如 Weapons Masters）擁有自己的戰鬥機制，強行讓它們與 Epic Fight 運作可能會造成混亂。因此，必須先進行測試。</em></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">由於這是我的第一個資料包/模組，感覺就像跳進深淵卻不會游泳一樣。我對 Java 了解不多，也還不完全明白它如何與 Minecraft 模組配合運作，但我正在學習中。此外，我還是一名學生，所以可能會因為課業或其他事情變得很忙，大部分空閒時間都在玩別的東西，希望大家能見諒。</p>\n<p>另外，如果我有任何拼寫錯誤請見諒，英文不是我的母語。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
